name: UK-First Results
description: Boost UK sources and demote social media and low-value domains.
public: true
author: LaurieB

# Boost UK domains
promote:bbc.co.uk
promote:theguardian.com
promote:gov.uk

# Demote common low-signal content
-demote:reddit.com
-demote:quora.com
-demote:pinterest.com
-demote:facebook.com
-demote:x.com
-demote:twitter.com
